  "title": "Tanya's Boneless Short Ribs",
  "description": "Boneless, simmering short ribs broiled then thrown in the oven. Easy as 1-2-3. Hubby LOVES this dish and whines when I don't make it. If you like LOTS of sauce double the liquid amounts. Great for indoor cooking nights....",
  "authors": [
    "Tanya Preston"
  ],
